Z||000006||Phil||03-12-2000||08:28 PM||||Don't know about notching the frame but you will have to add in the cost of having the axles put together also.||||reg||1
Z||000007||pherder||03-12-2000||08:32 PM||||You have to notch the frame on the Zumalt style of kit.<P>Also this type of kit uses counter sunk allen head bolts to mount the flywheel.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Also, the Zumalt kit was offering a split engine cradle design so that clutches could be changed easier (has to be done more often on this kit, it seems.)<P>Paul||||reg||1
